{"translation":{"id":"cmn_cbt","name":"Biblica® 聖經，當代譯本開放資源","website":"https://ebible.org/Scriptures/details.php?id=cmncbt","licenseUrl":"https://ebible.org/Scriptures/details.php?id=cmncbt","licenseNotes":null,"shortName":"CBT","englishName":"Chinese, Mandarin: Biblica® 聖經,當代譯本開放資源 (Bible)","language":"cmn","textDirection":"ltr","sha256":"b36dae22680d13a66a36842989888505161ddf7eefb726364331d95aae2197c4","availableFormats":["json"],"listOfBooksApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbt/books.json","numberOfBooks":66,"totalNumberOfChapters":1189,"totalNumberOfVerses":30961,"languageName":"中文","languageEnglishName":"Chinese"},"book":{"id":"JER","translationId":"cmn_cbt","name":"耶利米書","commonName":"耶利米書","title":"耶利米書","order":24,"numberOfChapters":52,"sha256":"681b5a173916e28ae5f3b5c6bb5d16263b7d167f21a486ef3c62ed1ab29150f3","firstChapterNumber":1,"firstChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbt/JER/1.json","lastChapterNumber":52,"lastChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbt/JER/52.json","totalNumberOfVerses":1352},"chapter":{"number":20,"content":[{"type":"heading","content":["耶利米受迫害"]},{"type":"verse","number":1,"content":["音麥的兒子巴施戶珥祭司在耶和華的殿中做總管。他聽見耶利米預言這些事，"]},{"type":"verse","number":2,"content":["便叫人毆打耶利米先知，用枷鎖把他鎖在耶和華殿的便雅憫上門處。"]},{"type":"verse","number":3,"content":["第二天，他打開枷鎖釋放了耶利米，耶利米對他說：「耶和華不再叫你巴施戶珥，要叫你瑪歌珥·米撒畢",{"noteId":6},"。"]},{"type":"verse","number":4,"content":["因為耶和華說，『我要使你和你的朋友都驚慌失措，讓你親眼看見你的朋友死在敵人刀下。我要把猶大人都交在巴比倫王手中，使他們或被擄到巴比倫或死於刀下。"]},{"type":"verse","number":5,"content":["我要把這城裡所有的財富、出產、珍寶，甚至猶大列王的寶物都交給敵人，帶到巴比倫作戰利品。"]},{"type":"verse","number":6,"content":["你巴施戶珥和你所有的家人，以及聽你說假預言的朋友都要被擄到巴比倫，死在那裡，葬在那裡。』」"]},{"type":"heading","content":["耶利米的抱怨"]},{"type":"verse","number":7,"content":[{"text":"耶和華啊，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你欺騙我，我被你騙了。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你制伏我，勝過我。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"如今，我終日被嘲笑，人人戲弄我。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":8,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我每次說預言，都大聲疾呼：","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"「暴力和毀滅要來了！」","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我因傳講耶和華的話而終日遭受侮辱和譏笑。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":9,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"有時我打算不再提起耶和華，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"不再奉祂的名宣講，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"但祂的話如一團火在我心中燃燒，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"憋在我骨頭裡，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我無法隱忍，不得不說。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":10,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我聽見許多人竊竊私語，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"恐怖四下瀰漫。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"他們說：「我們告發他！告發他！」","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我的好友都盼著我滅亡，說：","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"「或許他會受騙，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"那樣我們便能打倒他，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"一洩心頭之恨。」","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":11,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"但耶和華與我同在，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"祂像勇猛的戰士。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"所以迫害我的人必一敗塗地，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"他們因失敗而羞愧難當，留下永遠的恥辱。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":12,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"考驗義人、洞悉人心的萬軍之耶和華啊，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"求你讓我看見你報應他們，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"因為我已向你稟明案情。","poem":1}]},{"type":"line_break"},{"type":"verse","number":13,"content":[{"text":"你們要歌頌耶和華！","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"要讚美耶和華！","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"因為祂從惡人手中救出窮人。","poem":1}]},{"type":"line_break"},{"type":"verse","number":14,"content":[{"text":"願我出生的那天受咒詛！","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"願我母親生我的那天不蒙祝福！","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":15,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"願那告訴我父親喜得貴子、","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"使他歡喜的人受咒詛！","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":16,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"願那人像被耶和華無情毀滅的城！","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"願他早晨聽見哀鳴，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"中午聽見戰爭的吶喊，","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":17,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"因為他沒有把我殺死在母腹中，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"沒有使母腹成為我的墳墓，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"讓我永遠留在裡面。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":18,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"為什麼我要從母胎出來，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"經歷患難和痛苦，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"在羞辱中度過一生呢？","poem":1}]}],"footnotes":[{"noteId":6,"caller":"+","text":"「瑪歌珥·米撒畢」意思是「四面有恐怖」。","reference":{"chapter":20,"verse":3}}]},"thisChapterLink":"/api/cmn_cbt/JER/20.json","thisChapterAudioLinks":{},"nextChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbt/JER/21.json","nextChapterAudioLinks":{},"previousChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbt/JER/19.json","previousChapterAudioLinks":{},"numberOfVerses":18}